006000
006100 01  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
006200     05  MSG-TEXT.
               10  MESSAGE-BUFFER-1 PIC X(1).
               10  FILLER           PIC X(67).
006300     05  MSG-FLD          PIC X(8)   VALUE SPACES.
006400     05  MSG-FLD-9 REDEFINES MSG-FLD PIC ZZZZZZZ9.
006500
006900 01  FIELD-NUMBER         PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE 1.
007000
